<section class="content">

<h3>Verse to memorize</h3>

<div class="bible-passage">
<p>«The effect of righteousness will be peace, and the result of righteousness, quietness and trust forever.»</p>
<p class="bible-passage__ref">&mdash; Isaiah 32:17</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for this week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus, you who entered Zacchaeus's house and awakened justice in him,<br />
enter my life and show me what I need to give back.<br />
Give me the courage to repair the harm I have caused,<br />
the honesty to pay fairly those who work for me,<br />
and an open heart to share with those who have the least.<br />
Help me to understand that true peace<br />
is only born from the justice your Spirit sows.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

